<body>
    <h1>College Management System - Project Manual</h1>
    <p>Handover Date: March 31, 2026 | Version: 1.0.0 (Production Ready)</p>

    <h2>1. Project Scope & Features</h2>
    <p>A comprehensive College Management System (CMS) featuring:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>AI Tutor</strong>: PDF-based context learning using Gemini 1.5 Flash.</li>
        <li><strong>Student Info</strong>: Success probability charts and academic tracking.</li>
        <li><strong>Assignments</strong>: Full lifecycle from student upload to faculty grading.</li>
        <li><strong>Finance Dashboard</strong>: Advanced fee filtering (Class/Student-wise) and CSV reports.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Notifications</strong>: Resend integration for automated student alerts.</li>
        <li><strong>Mobile App (PWA)</strong>: Full "Add to Home Screen" support on iOS and Android.</li>
    </ul>

