    <h2>3. User Acceptance Testing (UAT) Checklist</h2>
    <p>Please verify each of the following:</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Module</th>
            <th>Test Step</th>
            <th>Result</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Authentication</td>
            <td>Login as Admin, Teacher, and Student roles.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Branding</td>
            <td>Upload Logo in Settings and verify it appears globally.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>AI Tutor</td>
            <td>Upload a PDF and ask a specific question.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Assignments</td>
            <td>Submit work as Student, Grade work as Teacher.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Finance</td>
            <td>Export a CSV report of overdue students.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>System Admin</td>
            <td>Toggle between "Demo" and "Live" modes.</td>
            <td>[ ] Pass / [ ] Fail</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h2>4. Technical & Deployment Guide</h2>
    <p>Detailed technical steps are provided in the PROJECT_GUIDE.md file. Briefly:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>Initialise Database: Run the SQL scripts in Supabase.</li>
        <li>Set up Storage: Create 'submissions' and 'branding' buckets.</li>
        <li>Configure Environment Variables: Supabase, Gemini, and Resend keys.</li>
        <li>Deploy to Vercel: Connect your GitHub Repo for automatic builds.</li>
    </ol>

